{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_CanTSyn_00033","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_CanTSyn_00033@rel:R19-11#42b81f5d","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_CanTSyn_00033","release":"R19-11","content":"Each transmission request of a SYNC message shall be monitored for a transmit confirmation timeout CanTSyn MasterConfirmationTimeout ( ECUC_CanTSyn_00020 : ). If the timeout occurs, the transmission request shall be revoked and no FUP message shall be sent.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverCAN.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:12:27+00:00"},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_CanTSyn_00033","release":"R20-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_CanTSyn_00033@rel:R21-11#cd37abd1","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_CanTSyn_00033","release":"R21-11","content":"Each transmission request of a SYNC message shall be monitored for a transmit confirmation timeout. If CanTSyn_TxConfirmation is not called within 3 sec after transmission request, CanTSyn shall • wait until CanTSyn_TxConfirmation is called (with E_OK or E_NOT_OK ) and • send no FUP message and • instead reset the state machine to start with a new SYNC transmission once it is due.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_TimeSyncOverCAN.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:13:12+00:00"},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_CanTSyn_00033","release":"R22-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_CanTSyn_00033","release":"R23-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_CanTSyn_00033","release":"R24-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/rec